---
description: Frontend hardening (anti infinite loading, server/client boundary, type normalization)
globs:
  - src/app/**/*.tsx
  - src/components/**/*.tsx
  - src/lib/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: true
---

Hardening rules for any frontend change.

- Never leave `isLoading` stuck. Every async path in Client Components MUST set loading false in `finally`.
- Never swallow errors silently in Client Components. Surface user-visible error state or message.
- Keep DB shape normalization in `src/lib/**` or Server Components:
  - `NUMERIC` → number
  - bigint string → number
  - JSON string → parse safely
- Client Components should NOT call Supabase directly unless the repo already does in that specific area.
- Prefer Server Components for initial data fetch; pass props to interactive Client Components.
- Keep UI responsive:
  - debounce search (300ms) when client-filtering
  - disable buttons on submit
  - show empty/error states instead of blank.
- Do **not** add `"use client"` at page level unless the entire page needs client hooks.
- Do **not** create duplicate `Foo.js` alongside `Foo.ts`/`Foo.tsx` under `src/`.
